{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj46cbdKNJj8RtKKm73Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple wooden door, ancient oak, iron-banded, set into a stone archway.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at center height.*\n\n*The key slides in.*\n\n*Tumblers shift — one, two, three — a deep resonant CHUNK echoes through the frame.*\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of long stillness.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor lit by guttering torchlight, the smell of old stone and something faintly sweet, like forgotten incense.*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":134,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}